# Trivy ignored findings for legacy-be-c.
# Format: one finding ID per line (CVE-IDs and misconfiguration IDs such as
# AVD-DS-0002 are both recognized). Only findings that were reviewed and
# explicitly accepted belong here; secrets are never ignored.

# Upstream eclipse-mosquitto Dockerfiles (mosquitto/docker/*) are third-party
# artifacts pulled in through the mosquitto git submodule. This workspace does
# not own or ship them, and editing upstream files is out of scope. The images
# run the broker without a USER directive (DS-0002) and the Ubuntu image omits
# apt --no-install-recommends (DS-0029). Accepted risk pending an upstream fix;
# re-verify on every mosquitto submodule bump.
DS-0002
DS-0029
